{"code":"080720","name":"한국유니온제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 1985년 유니온제약주식회사로 설립되어 2001년 한국유니온제약주식회사로 상호 변경, 2018년 코스닥에 상장하였음. 현재 비상장 종속회사 2개사를 보유 중이나, 2024년 상장적격성 실질심사 사유 발생으로 2026년 상장폐지가 의결됨. 동사는 전문의약품 제조업체로, GMP 제형을 갖추고 항생제, 근골격계, 순환기계, 소화기계 품목 주력으로 제조·판매하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":2410.0,"open":2410.0,"high":2410.0,"low":2410.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":0.0,"ret_60":0.0,"ret_120":0.0,"ret_250":0.0,"ma20":2410.0,"ma60":2410.0,"ma120":2410.0,"ma200":2410.0,"close_vs_ma200":0.0,"close_vs_ma60":0.0,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":0.0,"r2_60":null,"slope_120":0.0,"r2_120":0.0,"slope_250":0.0,"r2_250":0.0,"high52":2410.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":100.0,"dd_52w":0.0,"mdd_1y":0.0,"atr14_pct":85.7143,"vol_ann_60":0.0,"vol_avg20":0.0,"vol_ratio20":null,"vr5":null,"vr20":null,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":0.0,"amount_avg60":0.0,"obv_chg20":null,"turnover_20":0.0,"pv_eff_20":null,"rsi14":null,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":0.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_60":0.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_120":0.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0,"foreign_ratio":0.06,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-1.75,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-13.0,"op_margin_q":-22.0339,"op_qoq":18.75,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":55.1724,"rev_yoy":-42.1569,"op_trend_4q":69.6104,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-137.86,"debt_ratio":130.41,"per":null,"pbr":1.4,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.06,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cns_per":null,"code":"080720","name":"한국유니온제약","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_code":"261","sector_name":"제약","ma